+On the other hand, multimodal question answering requires joint reasoning over evidence from text and images~\cite{bg-mmqa}. Different questions about the same image can require different visual details~\cite{bg-stacked-attention,lit-antol2015vqa}. Instruction-aware visual extraction further makes the selected features depend on the requested task~\cite{lit-dai2023instructblip}. A relation stated directly in a question may also correspond to several relations in the evidence.
